### One adult
POST http://localhost:8080/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c1","currency":"EUR","lines":[{"category":"ADULT","quantity":1}]}

### PRC-401 eight add-ons
POST http://localhost:8080/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c1","currency":"EUR","lines":[{"category":"ADDON","quantity":8}]}

### PRC-402 party of 10
POST http://localhost:8080/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c1","currency":"EUR","lines":[{"category":"ADULT","quantity":10}]}

### PRC-403 yen
POST http://localhost:8080/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"c1","currency":"JPY","promoCode":"TEN","lines":[{"category":"ADULT","quantity":3}]}

### Partner band
GET http://localhost:8080/price-bands/match?currency=EUR&amount=10.00
